Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.00,1:29:54.10,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,《死神来了2》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.39,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,明天是VOLAI180号航班…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow marks the one year anniversary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:23.27,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,坠机爆炸一周年纪念日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since Velez Air Flight 180 exploded and crashed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:25.48,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,此航班是在JFK机场起飞后不久发生坠毁的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shortly after takeoff from JFK Airport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.67,0:00:27.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这次灾难波及多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a disaster that's affected many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.78,0:00:30.27,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,最严重的应该算是亚伯拉罕高中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None more so than Mt Abraham High School,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:34.20,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,共有40名学生和4名教师丧生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which lost 40 students and four faculty members in the crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.49,0:00:36.60,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,但灾难后发生的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it was the events after the crash{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:39.67,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,使这场悲剧变得却更加离奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that has turned this tragic story into something even stranger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:44.31,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那些在坠机前侥幸逃脱的幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The survivors who managed to get off the plane before it crashed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.42,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,很快死于一系列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}died soon thereafter in a series{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.61,0:00:48.82,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,神秘离奇的事故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of mysterious and bizarre accidents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.01,0:00:52.08,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,对一些人来说 这只是悲剧性的巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,to some,these deaths are just tragic coincidences,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.37,0:00:54.19,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,但对另一些人来说 却预示着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but to others,they're an indication{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:56.68,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,某种不祥的事情即将发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that there are more sinister events taking place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.87,0:00:58.60,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是今晚嘉宾们要讨论的话题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the contention of tonight's guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:00.52,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们的参与\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for joining us this evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:02.05,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你邀请我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for having me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:04.16,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我很喜欢你用的"不祥"一词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I appreciate you using the word sinister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.35,0:01:07.65,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,大多数人都说是"超自然"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most people say supernatural because they think I'm talking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:10.91,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们以为我谈论的是"鬼魂"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about ghosts and witches and stuff like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.11,0:01:13.41,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,请直接谈论这个话题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's your chance to set the record straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:15.80,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:19.35,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为有某种力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe that there's a sort of force,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.54,0:01:23.19,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,一种看不见的可怕的东西…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an unseen malevolent presence...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.48,0:01:25.20,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,整天都围绕在我们的周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's all around us every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.30,0:01:28.46,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这种东西导致了人们的苦难和死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it determines when we live and die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:33.28,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,有些人称之为"魔鬼的力量"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And some people call this force the devil,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:36.37,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我认为这有点宗教化了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I think that whole religious thing is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:39.63,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿称之为"死亡"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I prefer to call it Death itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.72,0:01:42.12,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那么按照你看法 我们被死亡包围?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm surrounded by Death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.31,0:01:44.23,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely. Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:47.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 每天 每时 无处不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day,everywhere,all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.78,0:01:51.17,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我想大家知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's what I want people to understand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.37,0:01:53.09,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡对我们每个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Death has this grand design{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:55.20,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,都有适合他自己的设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we all fit into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:57.79,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,当布朗宁从飞机上…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when Alex Browning got off that plane{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:00.00,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,救走那些生还者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and took the other survivors with him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.09,0:02:02.39,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上他是破坏了死亡的设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he basically screwed up Death's plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:05.17,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我要警告大家的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's what I'm trying to warn people about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:08.24,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的幸存者都已经死去…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the fact that all of the survivors have died{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:10.35,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你的证据吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is your evidence of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:15.76,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是生还者死不死的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,it's not so much that the survivors died,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:17.87,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,而是这些人是怎么死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's the way that they died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:21.23,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说他们死得那么奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,there were so many weird,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.33,0:02:23.91,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,或者说看上去随意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seemingly random things about the way they died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.11,0:02:27.46,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,根本无法解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just didn't make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:30.43,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这就证明了确实有某种力量存在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's the proof there's something out there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:33.98,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 这不是证据 这只是你的一面之词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait,that's not proof. That is your interpretation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:37.05,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你这样说只是为了证明你的观点 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of events that can't be proven in order to support your ideas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:40.26,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,凯柏莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimberly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:42.37,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你的思想应该开放点…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be more open-minded...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.50,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,任何事都是可能的 那些只是巧合罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened after that was just coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:46.76,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,能让我说完吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I finish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:50.04,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,巧合只会让一两个人死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mere coincidence would have one or two of these kids die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:52.24,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,而不会让这些人包括他们的老师都死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not all of them including their teachers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:54.64,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 任何时候都有人死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,but people die all the time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:57.04,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这次又有何不同?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so why should this be any different?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:02:59.44,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这就迫使大家…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It forced people to question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.63,0:03:01.93,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,都对日常的巧合产生了疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these so-called everyday coincidences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:04.85,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这背后隐藏着什么怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if they were something more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.96,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是我们能做些什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if you could do something about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.15,0:03:09.64,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你听听你自己 你简直疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please,are you listening to yourself? This is crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:12.90,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们每天早晨离家后 都得小心翼翼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saying we should be on guard every morning when we leave the house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:15.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我就是此意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what I'm saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:17.79,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.98,0:03:19.61,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,为了逃过此劫…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in order to survive...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:22.01,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only way to survive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:24.22,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,就是看到隐藏在这个可见的世界下面的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to look beneath the visible world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.41,0:03:29.05,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,因为没有人可以躲避死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because in the end no one can escape death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:31.64,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,也许今天你就是你的死期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And today may be your day to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:45.45,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我会给你电话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,I'll call you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:48.46,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,凯柏莉 什么都带齐了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimberly,are you sure you've got everything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.65,0:03:50.57,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,信用卡 手机 3A卡?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Credit card,cell phone,Triple-A card?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:52.97,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,老爸啊 我是去玳多纳 可不是去索马里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad,it's Daytona,not Somalia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.16,0:03:56.61,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,补胎胶 防晒霜 催泪喷雾?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright. Fix-a-flat,road flares,sunblock,mace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:59.01,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,避孕套 鞭子 铁链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Condoms,whips,chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:01.70,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,开个玩笑 卡曼先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just kidding,Mr Corman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:03.42,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 我会照看她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry,I'll keep an eye on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:06.01,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你这样说 我就放心了 多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That makes me feel a lot better,thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:09.37,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Alrighty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:13.44,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们快去带上那些家伙吧 我等不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we go get the guys? I'm getting horny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.46,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,上路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:19.57,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我会打电话给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,I'll call you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.07,0:04:24.27,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,鞭子 铁链 你真会说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whips and chains. That's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:26.57,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你怎么说 你老爸对你真够好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever,your dad's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:31.86,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,系好安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buckle up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:01.93,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it!{\r}
