Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.47,0:18:11.00,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定听说过那个小孩子的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have read about the kid{\r}
