Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.43,0:33:45.97,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,还有别的什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.06,0:33:48.27,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚有一个人死的离奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the people died in a freak accident last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.46,0:33:50.38,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人也有危险吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if the other people are in danger,too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.57,0:33:52.77,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你把他们列入名单 那么他们实际上已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you put them on the list,they're already dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.97,0:33:56.08,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,名单? 什么名单?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}List? What list?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.17,0:33:58.18,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death's list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.68,0:34:02.69,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,180幸存者的名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The survivors of Flight 180{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.88,0:34:04.99,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的一个接一个死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}died in the exact order{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.18,0:34:07.68,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,他们本来就该在那次事件中死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they were originally meant to die in the plane crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.02,0:34:10.84,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那是死神最初的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was Death's original design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.18,0:34:13.72,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,计划好了一份名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.82,0:34:16.12,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,本来应该是在那次坠机事件中死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was supposed to die in that crash with my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.31,0:34:17.84,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 你是要告诉我 我是下一个该死的人了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're telling me that I'm next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.94,0:34:19.86,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过昨天晚上有人死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said someone else died last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.05,0:34:22.97,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这意味着已经有人干涉进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means someone must have intervened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.16,0:34:26.99,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,博格警官把我拖开 但是我的朋友死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer Burke pulled me away from the crash that killed my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.28,0:34:29.01,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.20,0:34:31.60,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你将会是最后一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be the last to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.79,0:34:34.09,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 你放心 一旦别的人都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't worry,once the others are dead,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.28,0:34:35.82,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,死神就会来找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it'll come back for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.16,0:34:38.98,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,死神一直是这样做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It always does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.42,0:34:41.95,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这没有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.05,0:34:46.08,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说 你们按照原来的次序死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said that you die in the order you're originally meant to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.36,0:34:49.82,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,但我的朋友在我的预感里面 是最后死的 而不是第一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my friends died last in my premonition,not first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.01,0:34:52.83,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.98,0:34:56.09,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,后死?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Died last?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.20,0:34:59.92,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,倒退型?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Backwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.02,0:35:01.94,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.76,0:35:05.49,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,在我的预感中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my premonition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.58,0:35:07.40,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫诺拉的女人和她的孩子都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Nora woman and her kid died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.60,0:35:10.38,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,接着是艾文 然后是我和我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then Evan,then me and my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.35,0:35:16.36,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这事情怎么会发生在我身上?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is this even happening to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.77,0:35:22.98,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,艾历克斯也经常这么问他自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what Alex used to ask himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.71,0:35:26.82,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那我该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,what am I supposed to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.01,0:35:28.73,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.36,0:35:33.09,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,注意一些迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out for the signs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.19,0:35:34.82,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.21,0:35:39.99,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有一些不祥的预兆?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever seen anything creepy or ominous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.19,0:35:42.68,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,反映在你眼帘里的相反事情?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An in-your-face irony kind of thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.98,0:35:47.28,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,收音机上的歌曲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The songs on the radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.47,0:35:50.76,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 还有啤酒运输车上的司机 还有路上看到的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,the guy in the beer truck,everything on the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.35,0:35:53.36,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那就别忽略了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,don't ignore it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.55,0:35:56.91,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,记往那些征兆 那可以保住你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recognising those signs usually means the difference between life and death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.20,0:35:59.50,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你得帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.60,0:36:01.13,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我没必要这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have to do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.23,0:36:02.76,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,可天机是你泄漏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you beat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.95,0:36:04.58,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,看看周围吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.77,0:36:06.50,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我泄漏什么天机了 凯柏莉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I beat,Kimberly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.90,0:36:11.87,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你明智的话 你就能自救 别人还是算了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you were smart,you'd save yourself and just forget about the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.06,0:36:14.36,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能这么说呢? 你有责任的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you say that? You have a responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.55,0:36:16.57,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.76,0:36:18.49,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我能这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how I can say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.40,0:36:23.47,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,当我对艾历克斯负责的时候 这就是他的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what happened to Alex when I was responsible for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.62,0:36:26.45,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,出去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.64,0:36:29.84,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,免得你伤害我或者你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you hurt me or yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.68,0:36:36.27,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 知道吗? - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alright,you know what? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.46,0:36:37.71,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你是个胆小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're a coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.90,0:36:39.43,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你之所以躲到这来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hide out in here because you're{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.53,0:36:42.40,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你倍受谴责 自私自利 不肯帮助其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}too damn bitter and selfish to help any other person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.69,0:36:45.42,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,在我看来 你已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my opinion,you're already dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.08,0:37:25.00,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我昨晚一直给你打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried calling you last night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.10,0:37:26.92,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,可你爸爸说你在睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but your father said you were sleeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.11,0:37:28.74,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 艾文·刘易斯死了 - 知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Evan Lewis is dead. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.93,0:37:31.90,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我今天早上不停接到事发现场的人打来的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been getting calls all morning from everyone who was on the on-ramp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.10,0:37:34.01,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我们在我家聚在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're meeting tonight at my apartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.71,0:37:38.18,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着…你相信所有这些死亡传说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait,so... you believe all this Death stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.52,0:37:41.92,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,开始我是不信的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,at first,no,I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.11,0:37:43.93,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,直到去年我被派去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until last year when I was dispatched{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.12,0:37:46.23,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,搜寻180次航班的幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to clean up one of the Flight 180 survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.25,0:37:47.88,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,清理现场…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clean up,I don't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.40,0:37:55.50,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看到了吗? - 看到什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you see that? - See what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.69,0:37:57.99,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 鸽子 - 鸽子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pigeons. - Pigeons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.19,0:37:59.91,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是一种迹象 - 什么迹象?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a sign. - A sign of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.10,0:38:01.73,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,如果克莱尔估计得对的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Clear's right about the order,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.93,0:38:04.80,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,诺拉和汤姆就要被鸽子袭击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then Nora and Tim are going to be attacked by pigeons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.99,0:38:06.43,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not following you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.53,0:38:08.06,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是死亡名单上下一个目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're next on Death's list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.25,0:38:10.56,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们找不到他们 他们会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't find them,they're going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.30,0:39:00.12,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆 医生准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doctor's ready for you,now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.31,0:39:02.04,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,要是他给我带上氧气罐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he gives me the gas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.23,0:39:04.15,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,等到我醒来时 裤子被脱掉的话…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I wake up with my pants unbuttoned...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.34,0:39:07.90,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那我们就不付钱 - 汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- we ain't paying. - Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.79,0:39:19.43,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,来了 汤姆 昨天你出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are. What happened to you yesterday,Tim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.72,0:39:20.39,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都想你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We missed you in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.49,0:39:22.79,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在23号公路上被耽搁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got hung up by that accident on Route 23.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.98,0:39:25.38,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 你没事真是走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good Lord. How lucky that you're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.20,0:39:29.12,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈说你最近牙疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mum says you've been having some pain lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.31,0:39:31.32,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,也不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.91,0:39:58.74,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我有点失望 汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm disappointed,Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.93,0:40:00.17,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈知道你抽烟了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does your mum know you've been smoking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.43,0:40:05.35,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 这颗牙齿要修补一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,that one's going to have to be filled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.69,0:40:08.42,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,真该死 那些鸽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn those pigeons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.61,0:40:11.68,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,要我换多少次玻璃 这些该死的鸽子才肯罢休?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times am I going to have to replace those goddamn windows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.05,0:40:19.45,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这样会有点疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will only sting for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.64,0:40:21.65,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,张开嘴巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.85,0:40:23.28,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,再大点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little bit wider.{\r}
