Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.32,0:42:51.15,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,吉恩 汤姆情况怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jean,how's Tim doing in there?{\r}
