Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.16,0:43:17.37,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 退后 退后! - 不 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay back,stay back! - No! Please,no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.01,0:43:38.12,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,诺拉不来了 她不肯离开她的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nora's not coming. She won't leave her son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.31,0:43:41.96,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不行 她是下一个… - 现在 我想她已经不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No,but she's next... - Right now I don't think she cares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.37,0:44:03.38,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,怪事又发生了 对不对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is really happening again,isn't it?{\r}
