Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.61,0:44:11.72,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔·莱维斯说的都是鬼话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Clear Rivers was just full of shit,{\r}
