Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.30,0:45:13.12,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是不肯告诉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about Death than he ever told us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.15,0:45:18.97,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不先敲门吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't we knock first?{\r}
