Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.38,0:46:28.35,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,问一个很简单的问题 我们不会打扰你和你的新朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a simple question and we'll leave you alone with your new friend.{\r}
