Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.24,0:46:50.93,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉过我 死神有个独特的构思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me Death has a distinct design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.12,0:46:54.09,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,可艾历克斯和我欺骗死神已经不止十几次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Alex and I cheated Death,not once but dozens of times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.28,0:46:56.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,构思是有缺陷的 可以被识破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The design is flawed,it can be beaten.{\r}
