Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.96,0:47:03.49,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是那么的生机勃勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just before they die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.68,0:47:05.31,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不这么认为吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think?{\r}
