Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.21,0:47:33.18,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你知道能帮助我们的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you know of anything that could help us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.37,0:47:35.19,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你会受到什么伤害呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what harm could it do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.34,0:47:40.51,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,只有新生可以打败死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only new life can defeat Death.{\r}
