Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.63,0:47:46.93,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,古人云: 万物皆有平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people say there's a balance to everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.08,0:47:49.71,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,有生必有死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For every life there's a death,{\r}
