Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.21,0:47:54.70,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,新生命的来临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the introduction of life that was not meant to be,{\r}
