Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.70,0:48:33.81,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哇! - 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa! - Wait a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.00,0:48:36.78,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,"新生打败死亡"? "跟随征兆"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"New life defeats death"? "Follow the signs"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.97,0:48:38.70,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那个家伙你是在哪找来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you find that guy?{\r}
