Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.61,0:48:54.68,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我想舔我的鸡巴 婊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinking suck on my junk,bee-atch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.88,0:48:56.51,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,小烂仔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little punk.{\r}
