Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.13,1:02:07.81,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 你不能这样做 - 别愣在那!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No,you can't do this to me. - Don't just stand there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.00,1:02:10.78,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快送我去医院! - 再让我想想!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get me to a hospital! - Give me a second to think!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.07,1:02:14.04,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能在监狱里生孩子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not going to have my baby in a jail cell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.24,1:02:15.77,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,送我去医院!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me to the hospital!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.96,1:02:17.69,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好 好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.88,1:02:21.26,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,培里长官 这是代理人亚当斯 回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff Perry,this is Deputy Adams,come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.00,1:02:25.30,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 我要车 培里长官 我需要车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God,I need the car! Sheriff Perry,I need the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.59,1:02:27.61,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我的面包车! 我的面包车! 用我的面包车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My van! My van! Take my van!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.91,1:02:31.34,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.54,1:02:33.45,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们走 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,we'll go. We'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.65,1:02:35.47,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,we'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.02,1:02:40.65,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.25,1:02:47.55,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你们想听点疯狂的事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Y'all want to hear something crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.74,1:02:49.66,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我第一次死里逃生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the first time I cheated Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.15,1:02:55.93,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,一个孩子带着刀来到学校…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A kid came to school with a knife...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.03,1:02:57.76,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他的老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}killed his teacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.58,1:03:01.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那个老师本应该就是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teacher would have been me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.69,1:03:05.14,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我两天前调离了那所学校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I was transferred to another school two days before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.24,1:03:07.25,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那真是太离奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fucking weird,man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.44,1:03:08.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,想听更离奇的事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want weird?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.78,1:03:10.70,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,去年我和我的搭档准备出行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last year my partner and I were heading out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.80,1:03:12.71,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,此时有个打来电话说火车失事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when a call came in about a train wreck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.41,1:03:15.92,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,弗兰克让我独自去处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank decided to let me handle it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.03,1:03:20.04,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,结果他当晚殉职了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died that night in a shootout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.19,1:03:24.07,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,如果电话晚打10秒钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that call had come in just 10 seconds later,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.36,1:03:25.99,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我也会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be dead,too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.08,1:03:28.10,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.19,1:03:29.92,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.11,1:03:31.55,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我也有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just I got one,too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.74,1:03:33.76,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,去年五月我想在宾夕法尼亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,so last May I'm supposed to go and stay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.85,1:03:36.34,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,一家低档旅馆往宿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at this cheesy little bed and breakfast in Pennsylvania.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.54,1:03:39.22,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人知道那里发生煤气泄漏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyhow,there's this major gas leak that no one knows about,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.41,1:03:41.62,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上所有的旅客都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all the guests suffocated during the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.81,1:03:43.96,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.15,1:03:45.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 我没有去那旅馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I never made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.78,1:03:48.28,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我坐的公交车撞了一个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bus I was on splattered some girl all over the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.47,1:03:49.71,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,被撞地点在亚伯拉罕?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that in Mt Abraham?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.31,1:03:52.98,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 你怎么知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. How did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.26,1:03:55.66,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你坐的公交车撞死了特里·泰莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That bus you were on killed Terry Chaney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.00,1:03:59.11,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,她也在180航班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was supposed to die on Flight 180.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.18,1:04:05.87,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你们听说过巴黎剧院倒塌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,do you guys remember that theatre in Paris{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.06,1:04:08.55,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,导致所有在场人员死亡?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that collapsed last year and killed everybody inside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.47,1:04:12.58,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来买了票去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,I had tickets to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.77,1:04:14.98,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我只能在巴黎呆一晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But one night I'm in Paris{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.17,1:04:18.14,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我还不如见识一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm just tripping on acid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.33,1:04:20.34,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,巴黎的夜生活轻松一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sipping lattes and such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.54,1:04:23.26,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,但是突然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then all of a sudden{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.45,1:04:26.33,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this dude out of nowhere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.52,1:04:28.73,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,被广告牌砸死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just gets whacked by this falling sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.92,1:04:31.41,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 卡特 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carter. - Wait,wait,wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.61,1:04:34.00,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那个死去的老师叫瓦尔·莱温顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The teacher I replaced,her name was Val Lewton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.19,1:04:36.88,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,她来自亚伯拉罕 死于爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was from Mt Abraham. She died in an explosion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.07,1:04:39.76,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的 那个关于火车失事的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. The call about the train wreck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.95,1:04:41.39,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,救了我的命…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that saved my life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.48,1:04:44.09,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那晚死掉的是比利·希契科克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was the night I scraped up Billy Hitchcock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.98,1:04:47.28,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 这些人都是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Who are these people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.71,1:04:50.54,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是180航班的乘客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people who got off of Flight 180.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.26,1:04:54.28,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,都是我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.63,1:04:59.74,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,凯柏莉 告诉我们你发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimberly,tell us what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.91,1:05:05.78,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,大约一年前 我妈和我去商场买东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About a year ago my mum and I were at the mall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.07,1:05:07.80,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来和妈妈去拿车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was supposed to meet her outside,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.89,1:05:10.19,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,但被记者截停访问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I got caught up watching this news report{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.39,1:05:12.11,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,关于年轻人自杀的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about some kid that committed suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.65,1:05:15.28,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kept thinking,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.47,1:05:17.67,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么有人会在在浴缸里扼死自己?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'How can you strangle yourself in the bathtub?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.87,1:05:19.50,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,真是蠢到头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.08,1:05:24.91,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It felt wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.00,1:05:26.73,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,然后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.61,1:05:32.67,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到几声枪响 于是我就跑出去看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard some gunshots and I ran outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.78,1:05:37.18,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是有几个孩子想偷我妈妈的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kids were trying to steal my mum's car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.47,1:05:39.77,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,她尽力和他们搏斗 她很英勇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She tried to fight them off,she was a fighter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.96,1:05:41.88,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,最后他们杀了我妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they killed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.71,1:05:47.77,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,葬礼过后 我一直在想 死的应该是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the funeral I kept thinking that it should have been me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.50,1:05:51.22,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜大家都这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess everyone must think that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.85,1:05:54.77,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,可我猜 我是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I guess I was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.59,1:06:07.37,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,能不能快点? 再开快点?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get there. Could you drive a little faster maybe?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.66,1:06:09.29,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这已经是最快了 - 天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm going as fast as I can. - God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.40,1:06:13.32,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,乘了180航班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we got off Flight 180,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.51,1:06:16.19,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不仅我们的命运都被改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it didn't just change our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.39,1:06:18.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这还影响到和我们接触的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It affected everyone and everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.78,1:06:20.80,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,任何人和事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've come into contact with since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.99,1:06:22.81,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我恐怕听不懂你的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure I'm understanding you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.00,1:06:25.21,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,本该死但我们却没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being alive after we were supposed to die,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.40,1:06:27.22,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,引起一阵涟漪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it caused an outward ripple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.41,1:06:29.14,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这违背了死神的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rift in Death's design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.33,1:06:33.11,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说 如果你没能生还…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you had never gotten off the plane...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.65,1:06:36.66,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可能早就死了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we wouldn't be alive in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.85,1:06:39.15,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 这就是死亡顺序反过来的原因!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,that's why Death is working backwards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.35,1:06:41.26,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,把所有薄弱点联系在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's tying up all the loose ends,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.45,1:06:43.56,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,一劳永逸的封住缺口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sealing the rift once and for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.76,1:07:07.00,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.02,1:07:10.55,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.14,1:07:14.96,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,撑往! 撑往!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on! Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.85,1:07:37.96,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大家都没事吧? - 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is everybody alright? - Oh God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.36,1:07:41.89,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 尤金!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God,Eugene!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.99,1:07:44.87,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他呼吸不了了 - 我的腿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He can't breathe. - Oh,my legs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.84,1:07:50.37,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,别去 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.56,1:07:53.06,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 孩子等不了了 - 我得去帮那些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not going to wait. - I got to go help those people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.25,1:07:55.26,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你想让我在这里生下孩子吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to deliver this baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.89,1:07:59.48,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那些人能帮他们 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those people can help. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.11,1:08:03.32,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,亚当斯警官报告 一辆车辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer Adams reporting a vehicle collision{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.51,1:08:05.43,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,在180英里处冲出9-A号公路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}off 9-A at the 180 mile-marker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.62,1:08:07.25,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,派所有应急车到现场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send all emergency vehicles to the scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.44,1:08:10.22,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们得走了 快! - 好 好 好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to go. Go! - Okay,okay,okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.41,1:08:12.91,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好了! 好了! 我们走! 我们走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just... okay,okay! We're going! We're going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.73,1:08:17.41,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 轻点放 - 躺这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Easy,easy. - Here,here,here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.51,1:08:19.62,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,他的肺功能大概衰竭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he has a collapsed lung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.71,1:08:22.81,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大家都没事吧? - 叫救护车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everyone okay? - Call an ambulance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.22,1:08:30.33,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,别抛下我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.52,1:08:31.77,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,hey you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.96,1:08:35.60,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Come on. Help me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.79,1:08:39.05,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,爆炸之前帮我逃出去 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to get me out of here before this thing explodes or something,okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.93,1:08:43.37,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.46,1:08:45.57,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我没闻到什么汽油味 也没有什么东西漏出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't smell any gas and nothing's dripping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.77,1:08:48.36,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 帮我把木棍拉出来 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright,get this thing off me. Just pull. Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.45,1:08:50.46,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 当心 准备好了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Be careful. Ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.90,1:08:55.68,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh God,Jethro! Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.88,1:08:57.99,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我完蛋之前我还要用我的腿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to be able to use my legs when I'm done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.18,1:09:00.09,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我…爸爸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so... Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.04,1:09:08.57,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,尤金 你会好起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eugene,everything's going to be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.67,1:09:11.26,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,要是没有呼吸器 他会撑不往的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he doesn't get a respirator,he's not going to make it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.45,1:09:14.14,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们送你去医院 - 当心点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're going to get you to the hospital. - Be careful with that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.23,1:09:17.40,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,检查好标准仪上的刻度 还要当心剂量!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check the gauges on the regulator,and watch out for overdoses!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.59,1:09:20.46,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还要当心湖泊和水坑 - 你不能上车 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And look out for potholes and puddles. - You can't come in,miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.19,1:09:24.20,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,还要当心电线!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And watch out for power lines!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.74,1:09:27.56,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,当心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.93,1:09:35.23,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你想找死吗 小家伙?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You trying to get yourself killed,little boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.42,1:09:38.53,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,得想开点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to use your head,man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.63,1:09:40.26,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,把那辆面包车开过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that news van back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.45,1:09:41.89,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.37,1:09:50.90,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.53,1:10:09.74,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么啦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is she doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.93,1:10:11.85,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我想应该没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she's going to be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.63,1:10:17.12,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 问你一个问题 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I ask you a question? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.14,1:10:20.96,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我死了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I die...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.05,1:10:22.78,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你会伤心吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is it going to hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.22,1:10:25.85,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.38,1:10:30.01,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你也会死 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to die after me,right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.36,1:10:32.99,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我想是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,I guess so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.00,1:10:36.82,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你能拿着这些吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you take these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.48,1:10:45.20,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我死了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I die...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.99,1:10:49.62,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,把我的这些毒品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you throw out all my drugs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.81,1:10:53.36,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,和色情书籍扔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my paraphernalia and my porno?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.85,1:10:57.38,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.38,1:10:59.68,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这些会让我妈妈心碎的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anything that's going to break my mum's heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.93,1:11:02.56,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.82,1:11:07.36,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.57,1:11:14.20,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我是夏恩·加克博山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Cheyenne Jacobson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.40,1:11:16.12,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,在基伯森农场为您报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}reporting live from the Gibbons farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.31,1:11:17.85,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,皮瑞郡长 我是布鲁克警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff Perry,Officer Burke here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.04,1:11:20.44,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我想得知一些有关伊莎贝拉·休顿的消息…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to get some information on Isabella...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.63,1:11:22.36,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,她走了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.55,1:11:24.94,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗? 好的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Thanks. Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.14,1:11:26.48,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,凯柏莉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimberly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.57,1:11:28.97,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,她到医院去了 快要分娩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isabella's at Lakeview Hospital. They're prepping her for delivery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.26,1:11:30.99,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们得走了 - 那凯特怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We got to go now. - What about Kat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.08,1:11:32.23,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我和她谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go talk to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.50,1:11:35.89,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.08,1:11:38.39,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你们去找她吧 再把事情说清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just find Isabella and get this thing over with,okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.58,1:11:40.11,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧 我没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on,I'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.92,1:11:48.74,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 劳里去哪里了? - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Rory? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.77,1:11:56.36,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你们能安静点吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you be a little quieter with that thing,please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.45,1:11:59.14,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 当然 我用安静档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,sure. I'll just put it on quiet mode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.43,1:12:00.67,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,那就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be good.{\r}
