Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.21,1:12:47.32,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.51,1:12:50.33,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,有人出来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody get out there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.52,1:12:53.21,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们必须得赶到医院! - 用我的卡车吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to get to the hospital now! - Well,take my truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.40,1:12:54.74,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The keys are in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.48,1:13:00.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,凯柏莉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimberly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.43,1:13:13.67,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,凯柏莉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimberly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.77,1:13:15.78,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 凯柏莉 - 你看到了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kimberly. - What do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.88,1:13:18.18,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们要找什么? - 不在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are we looking for? - It's not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.10,1:13:21.82,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这次不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one was different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.02,1:13:24.80,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,好像一辆面包车冲进了湖中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was like the van crashing into the lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.89,1:13:26.81,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我梦见我在医院 我在叫喊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in a hospital,there was screaming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.00,1:13:28.54,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,有个护士想掐死我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a nurse was trying to choke me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.34,1:13:31.74,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我看不到她的样子 但我看到她的名牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't see her,but I could see her name tag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.93,1:13:33.65,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,就在我眼前 克劳吉安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was right in my face. Kalarjian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.38,1:13:38.26,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我想一个叫克劳吉安的护士想杀死伊莎贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think a nurse named Kalarjian is going to try and kill Isabella.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.28,1:13:45.47,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 伊莎贝拉 你不能再用劲了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me,Isabella! I need you to stop pushing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.96,1:13:47.30,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 我的孩子还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong? Is my baby alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.49,1:13:49.70,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你夹着他的颈子 孩子有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cord's around the neck. This baby's in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.89,1:13:52.48,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,今天在一场车祸中有两人丧生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bizarre accident has left two people dead,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.67,1:13:55.26,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,一个被车内的安全保护装置杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of them killed by a safety device meant to protect us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.45,1:13:57.76,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这个女人在安全气袋膨胀之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ironically,the woman was impaled through the head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.85,1:14:00.06,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,在车内被戳穿了头颅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after her emergency airbag deployed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.13,1:14:04.39,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,她是在格林伍德发生车祸后被困在车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was trapped in her vehicle after it crashed into a field near Greenwood Lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.68,1:14:06.88,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,突然安全气袋膨胀开…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suddenly the airbag went off...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.25,1:14:43.17,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,伊莎贝拉·休顿在哪个病房?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isabella Hudson! What room is she in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.36,1:14:45.28,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得做个紧急处理!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may need to do a stat Caesarean!{\r}
